{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_107","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc 'echo \"=== FINAL VERIFICATION ===\" && echo \"\" && echo \"1. Backend review_state.py:\" && cat /workspace/services/api/src/review_state.py && echo \"\" && echo \"2. Backend releases.py:\" && cat /workspace/services/api/src/routes/releases.py && echo \"\" && echo \"3. Frontend ReleaseGateForm.tsx:\" && cat /workspace/apps/admin/src/components/ReleaseGateForm.tsx && echo \"\" && echo \"4. Frontend api.ts:\" && cat /workspace/apps/admin/src/lib/api.ts && echo \"\" && echo \"5. Runbook:\" && cat /workspace/docs/runbooks/release_gating.md && echo \"\" && echo \"6. Proof artifact:\" && cat /workspace/artifacts/dom/release_gate_capture.json && echo \"\" && echo \"7. Integration report:\" && cat /workspace/artifacts/report/integration_report.md'","aggregated_output":"=== FINAL VERIFICATION ===\n\n1. Backend review_state.py:\nDEFAULT_APPROVAL_STATE = \"human_review_required\"\nACTIVE_APPROVAL_STATES = {\"human_review_required\", \"auto_approve\", \"blocked\"}\n\n\ndef normalize_review_state(raw_state: str | None) -> str:\n    state = (raw_state or DEFAULT_APPROVAL_STATE).strip()\n    # Legacy compatibility: map manual_review to human_review_required\n    if state == \"manual_review\":\n        return \"human_review_required\"\n    if state in ACTIVE_APPROVAL_STATES:\n        return state\n    raise ValueError(f\"unsupported approval_state: {raw_state!r}\")\n\n2. Backend releases.py:\nfrom services.api.src.review_state import normalize_review_state\n\n\ndef build_release_gate_update(payload: dict) -> dict:\n    approval_state = normalize_review_state(payload.get(\"approval_state\", \"human_review_required\"))\n    return {\n        \"release_id\": payload[\"release_id\"],\n        \"approval_state\": approval_state,\n    }\n\n\ndef serialize_release_gate(record: dict) -> dict:\n    return {\n        \"release_id\": record[\"release_id\"],\n        \"approval_state\": record.get(\"approval_state\", \"human_review_required\"),\n        \"operator_hint\": \"verify human_review_required in the admin echo\",\n    }\n\n3. Frontend ReleaseGateForm.tsx:\nexport const defaultGateState = {\n  releaseId: \"rel-ship-0422\",\n  approvalState: \"human_review_required\",\n  operatorLabel: \"Human review required\",\n};\n\nexport function buildSeededGateForm() {\n  return { ...defaultGateState };\n}\n\n4. Frontend api.ts:\nexport function buildReleaseGateRequest(formState: { releaseId: string; approvalState: string }) {\n  return {\n    path: `/api/releases/${formState.releaseId}/gate`,\n    method: \"POST\",\n    body: {\n      release_id: formState.releaseId,\n      approval_state: formState.approvalState || \"human_review_required\",\n    },\n  };\n}\n\nexport function summarizeGateEcho(response: { approval_state: string }) {\n  return `Server echoed ${response.approval_state || \"human_review_required\"}`;\n}\n\n5. Runbook:\n# Release gating runbook\n\nRetired token: `manual_review`\nNew token: `human_review_required`\n\nVerification order:\n\n1. Submit the release gate from the admin form.\n2. Watch the server echo for `human_review_required`.\n3. Confirm the operator checklist matches the `human_review_required` token.\n\n6. Proof artifact:\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"cnb55.release_gate_capture.v1\",\n  \"variant_id\": \"v1-clean-baseline\",\n  \"seed_release_id\": \"rel-ship-0422\",\n  \"proof_type\": \"request_echo_pair\",\n  \"captured_request\": {\n    \"request_path\": \"/api/releases/rel-ship-0422/gate\",\n    \"approval_state\": \"human_review_required\"\n  },\n  \"server_echo\": {\n    \"echo_path\": \"/api/releases/rel-ship-0422\",\n    \"approval_state\": \"human_review_required\"\n  }\n}\n\n7. Integration report:\n# Integration Report: Release Gating Rename\n\n## Summary\n\nSuccessfully migrated the release-gating token from `manual_review` to `human_review_required` across backend parsing, frontend submission, and operator documentation.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### Backend (`services/api/src/`)\n\n- `review_state.py`: Updated `DEFAULT_APPROVAL_STATE` to `human_review_required`, added legacy compatibility mapping for `manual_review`\n- `releases.py`: Updated default approval state and operator hint to reference `human_review_required`\n\n### Frontend (`apps/admin/src/`)\n\n- `ReleaseGateForm.tsx`: Updated `defaultGateState.approvalState` to `human_review_required`\n- `api.ts`: Updated default `approval_state` in request builder to `human_review_required`\n\n### Documentation (`docs/runbooks/`)\n\n- `release_gating.md`: Documented retired token, new token, and verification order\n\n## Test Compatibility\n\n- `test_legacy_manual_review_normalizes()`: `manual_review` normalizes to `human_review_required` ✓\n- `test_release_gate_update_emits_new_token()`: Backend emits `human_review_required` ✓\n- `test_release_gate_echo_uses_new_token()`: Serialization uses `human_review_required` ✓\n- Frontend test expects `human_review_required` in request body ✓\n\n## Proof Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/dom/release_gate_capture.json`: Captured request and server echo both show `human_review_required` ✓\n\n## End-to-End Verification\n\nThe admin form submits `human_review_required`, the backend stores and echoes `human_review_required`, and the runbook tells operators to verify `human_review_required`.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
